ice: 台中機場捷運橘線獲行政院原則同意 (2026-08-24)","url":"https://tcrt.taichung.gov.tw/latestevent/Details?Parser=9%2C4%2C160%2C%2C%2C%2C1622","accessed":"2026-11-14"},{"id":"ctee-orange","title":"Commercial Times: 行政院原則同意台中機場捷運橘線可行性研究 (2026-08-24)","url":"https://www.ctee.com.tw/news/20260824701699-431401","accessed":"2026-11-14"},{"id":"bella-orange","title":"Bella: Taichung MRT Orange (Airport) Line station list (2026-08-26)","url":"https://www.bella.tw/articles/design&gadget/59684/taichung-new-mrt-orange-airport-line-completion-2042","accessed":"2026-11-14"}],"notes":"Covers Taichung and Changhua, clipped to lng 120.45-120.85 / lat 23.95-24.42 (TRA lines are cut at the last station inside that box; THSR is shown Miaoli - Changhua). Geometry and station positions © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (Green Line from its route relation; TRA and THSR routed on the OSM track network; simplified ~15 m). Interchanges are merged when stations share a name within ~450 m; the HSR Taichung complex (THSR Taichung, TRA Xinwuri, MRT HSR Taichung Station) is one station. Colours: MRT lines use the values from Taichung MRT line diagrams as collected on Wikipedia (no official hex specification found); TRA and THSR have no line colours (colours chosen for the map). Projects: Blue Line (comprehensive plan approved 2024-01-29; Taichung Port - Dazhuang under construction since 2026-08-12; target 2034, the underground section may slip to 2036), Green Line extensions to Dakeng and Changhua (planned: feasibility approved 2024-01-31, comprehensive plan under MOTC review), Orange (Airport) Line (planned: feasibility approved in principle 2026-08-18; media estimate ~2042), Blue Line Taiping extension (proposed). Future station names are working names (English names mostly unofficial) and positions approximate, some to about 1 km. Not included: Taichung Red Line (Chongde - Fengyuan, feasibility study), Orange Line coast extension, the Taichung mountain-coast rail loop (山海環線) and Changhua railway elevation (feasibility stage), Changhua LRT."}